# Drum & Dance 2018

_Drum & Dance 2018 - Saturday January 13th from 12pm._ Are your NY Resolutions this much fun? Join us for a day of [drum and dance](/classes/) to welcome the New Year. This will be our first event back for 2018 and a great opportunity to get your drum and dance dose for the holiday period or try the classes out for the first time in preparation for all new classes starting on February 6th 2018. There will be live drumming for the dance classes and loads of awesome and exciting new material. Last chance to catch a class with Nathaniel before he heads off to Africa for a month!

## Drum & Dance 2018 Program:

### Saturday January 13th 2018

12pm - 12.45pm DRUM CIRCLE 1pm - 1.45pm African drumming 2pm- 2.45pm African dance 3pm - 3.45pm African drumming 4pm - 4.45pm African dance 5pm - 5.45pm Dundun dance All Welcome! All Classes - $15 [Book Online -](/classes/) Scroll down and click the choose you class button. Palmwoods Memorial Hall 1 Main St, Palmwoods Ph 0434585992 for more info or email: info@rhythmculture.com.au
